- Forecast scenarios (3): Base, Upside (improve collections/increase revenue), Downside (revenue drop / slower collections)

Suggested runway sensitivity examples (to include in appendix)
- At $72K/mo burn → runway ≈ 29 months
- At $105K/mo burn → runway = 20 months
- At $150K/mo burn → runway ≈ 14 months
