"Metro Manufacturing enters this quarter with $2.1M in cash. At the current operating burn of ~$72K per month, we have ample runway (~29 months); however, planned investments could reduce runway to ~20 months if monthly spend increases to ~$105K. Last quarter revenue was $1.8M and remains our primary lever to extend runway through margin improvements and faster collections. Management recommends pausing non-essential hires, accelerating receivables collections, and presenting a milestone-based investment plan for any incremental spend above $X/month. We will present a 3-scenario forecast (base, upside, downside) and a 12-month financing plan at the next board meeting."

