- Option B: Build the 3-scenario 12-month cash forecast (I’ll need revenue/expense details or I can use reasonable assumptions you approve).
- Option C: Draft the 6-slide deck.
Tell me which option (or combination) and confirm how you want me to treat the runway/burn numbers (which is correct, or should I assume runway is based on a no-revenue or downside case?).

