5. Working capital / receivables (Likelihood: Medium, Impact: Medium)
   - Mitigation: tighten payment terms, offer early-pay discounts, pursue factoring if AR days spike.
   - Owner: Finance lead

6. Supply chain disruptions (Likelihood: Medium, Impact: Medium)
