- “Metro Manufacturing ends the period with $2.1M in cash and $1.8M revenue last quarter (annualized ~$7.2M). Under our current plan we have a projected runway of [confirm: 20 months OR ~29 months at reported $72K monthly burn]. Near term priorities are to (1) reconcile and stress‑test the cash forecast, (2) prioritize hires and discretionary spend to protect runway, and (3) execute targeted revenue retention and acceleration programs. We request the board’s approval for the contingency hiring/capex plan and authorization to pursue a small bridge raise if downside stress tests require additional cushion.”

