- A 1-page single-slide text block (bullet points) for the board meeting packet? OR
- A full one-page narrative plus a 1-slide risk/mitigation graphic? OR
- The actual slide text and speaker notes I can draft for you?

Also please confirm:
1) Which runway/burn is correct (72K burn or 20-month runway with implied 105K burn)?
2) Any upcoming one-time cash items (debt payments, capex, hiring, customer refunds) in the next 6 months?
3) Any major customer concentration or planned fundraising timeline?

Tell me which of the deliverable options you want and confirm the numbers; I’ll draft the final board-ready content.

