- We are in a stable short-to-medium term cash position, providing substantial runway to execute strategic initiatives. Immediate focus should be on validating recurring revenue and customer concentration, protecting margins, and investing selectively in highest-return growth initiatives. I recommend the board approve a 90-day plan to (1) validate revenue stability, (2) freeze non-essential hires, (3) accelerate collections and extend payables where appropriate, and (4) prepare a fundraising plan only if downside scenarios reduce runway below ~18 months.

