- Middle-right: Key KPIs (ARR or annualized revenue, monthly revenue, gross margin %, customer concentration %, DSO/DPO, CAC, LTV if available)
- Bottom-left: 3 scenarios (Base / Downside / Upside) with runway impact
- Bottom-right: Top 5 risks + mitigations and immediate asks (e.g., approve hiring freeze, authorize bridge financing, etc.)

4) Scenario math (quick sensitivity examples)
- Base (burn $72k/mo): runway ≈ 29.2 months
- Mild downside (+25% burn → $90k/mo): runway ≈ 23.3 months
- Severe downside (+50% burn → $108k/mo): runway ≈ 19.4 months
- If runway target is 20 months → current implied burn ≈ $105k/mo (close to the severe downside case)

5) Top risks, mitigations, and metrics to report
