  - Metrics: Days cash on hand, weekly cash forecast, committed vs uncommitted cash.
- Revenue concentration / client loss
  - Mitigations: Diversify top 10 customers, accelerate negotiations with existing pipeline, create contingency contracts.
  - Metrics: % revenue from top 5 customers, pipeline coverage ratio, churn rate.
- Demand / market slowdown
  - Mitigations: Short-term promotions, re-prioritize sales efforts to higher-margin segments, focus on renewals.
  - Metrics: Bookings vs target, sales velocity, win rate.
- Margin compression / input cost increases (supply chain)
  - Mitigations: Lock in supplier pricing, pass-through clauses, increase product pricing selectively.
  - Metrics: Gross margin %, input cost index, supplier lead times.
- Execution risk on growth initiatives (product rollouts, capital projects)
  - Mitigations: Stage-gate approvals, reduce scope of large projects, reallocate budget to high-ROI activities.
  - Metrics: Project burn vs plan, milestone attainment, ROI projections.

