   - Mitigations: secure hedges/longer supplier contracts for key materials, renegotiate pricing where possible, pass through selective cost increases to customers with clear communication.
3) Customer concentration risk (if a few customers represent large share of revenue)
   - Mitigations: diversify pipeline, prioritize cross-sell/up-sell, create contingency plans for largest customers (e.g., staged spend reductions).
