4) Top 6 key risks (prioritized) + mitigation steps
1. Runway mis-estimation (data/assumption risk)
   - Why: Inconsistent numbers (2.1M, $72K burn, 20 months). If planned capex, receivables, or payables are omitted, runway could be shorter.
   - Mitigation: Immediate reconciling of cash forecast (monthly P&L & cash flow) for next 12 months; produce a worst/likely/best cash-scenario; surface any one-time payouts or debt covenants.

