Below is a concise board summary, financial narrative options, and prioritized key risks + mitigations.

1) Executive (one‑page) board summary — (use either “Base” or “Adjusted” depending on which runway you confirm)
- Headline: “Strong liquidity position; runway sufficient to execute growth plan but requires active monitoring of revenue and working capital.”
