  - DSO (days sales outstanding)
  - Bookings / backlog
- If runway < 18 months (after confirming burn), prepare a capital plan: target raise size, timeline, and dilution scenarios.
- If runway >= 24 months, recommend focusing on growth investments while maintaining tighter working capital controls.

