3) Key risks (ranked) with mitigation and owner
- Revenue concentration (high risk)
  - Risk: Large customers contribute a high share of revenue -> loss would materially reduce revenue.
  - Mitigation: Diversify pipeline, negotiate multi-quarter contracts, introduce minimum purchase clauses.
  - Owner: Head of Sales + CFO
