- Approve the three-scenario financial model and assumptions by [date].
- Approve an action plan for revenue concentration mitigation within 60 days.
- Authorize the CFO to begin a funding process if runway falls below 12 months or if downside scenario triggers.
- Request monthly (or biweekly) cash & KPI dashboard for the Board.

