2. Do you have monthly P&L or cashflow for the last 6 months (or a breakout of payroll, COGS, SG&A, capex)?
3. Any imminent cash events or debt maturities in the next 3–6 months?
4. Timeline: when is the board meeting and when do you need the deck/memo?

Tell me which items you want me to prepare next (e.g., 1-page board memo, slide bullets, 12-month scenarios) and answer the quick questions above. I’ll draft the materials immediately after your confirmation.

