- Metro Manufacturing has $2.1M cash on hand. Last quarter revenue was $1.8M (≈ $600K/month). There’s a discrepancy between reported runway (20 months) and the stated burn ($72K/month) — if burn = $72K/month runway would be ~29 months; if runway = 20 months implied burn is ~$105K/month. I’ve prepared the summary below with both interpretations noted. Key point for the board: we appear to have multi-quarter runway, but we must confirm burn definition and near-term cash commitments (debt, capex, one-offs) before concluding.

