Board summary — concise (for slide or one-page memo)
- Current cash: $2.1M
- Revenue (last quarter): $1.8M (annualized ≈ $7.2M)
- Burn / runway (choose one, confirm which is correct):
  - If burn = $72K/month → Runway ≈ 29 months
  - If runway = 20 months → Implied burn ≈ $105K/month
