- Impact: High/Med — losing a top customer or billing delays could materially reduce cash receipts.
- Mitigations: quantify % revenue from top 5 customers; accelerate collections (shorten payment terms, offer early payment discounts), strengthen sales pipeline focusing on higher-margin accounts.

3) Margin compression / cost inflation (materials, freight)
- Impact: Medium — squeezes profitability and increases net burn.
- Mitigations: pass-through pricing where possible, renegotiate supplier terms, hedge key input costs, improve manufacturing efficiency.

