A: Not immediately if burn is $72K/month (runway ≈29 months). If burn is $105K/month (20 months runway), we don’t need immediate capital but should prepare materials and start early outreach to preserve optionality and leverage.

Q: Where can we cut without hurting growth?
A: Freeze noncritical hires, reduce low-performing marketing channels, renegotiate vendor contracts, shift spend toward high-conversion sales enablement.

