Suggested one-page Board summary (headline + bullets)
Headline: Metro Manufacturing is cash-positive with a strong top-line quarter ($1.8M) and a current cash balance of $2.1M. Depending on burn definition, runway is between ~20–29 months. Focus near-term: translate strong revenue into margin expansion, de-risk customer concentration, and lock-in cash collections to preserve runway.

Snapshot (2–3 bullets)
- Cash: $2.1M on hand (as of [date])
- Revenue (last quarter): $1.8M (≈ $600K/mo)
- Burn: $72K/mo (please confirm net vs gross) — implies ~29 months runway; if runway=20 months, implied burn ≈ $105K/mo
